六、禁止行为 / PROHIBITED CONDUCT
================================================================================

6.1 未经商业授权，不得将优雅草任何产品用于任何形式的商业用途（包括但不限于销售、出租、运营、集成进收费产品、以营利为目的的分发或再许可）。

6.1 Without a commercial license, you may not use any Youyacao product for any form of commercial use (including but not limited to sale, rental, operation, integration into paid products, or distribution or sublicensing for profit).

6.2 禁止在优雅草产品或其二次开发版本基础上，进行「衍生子版本」的开发、包装、命名或售卖。包括但不限于：以本产品为基础开发衍生版本、修改版本或第三方发行版并对外销售或再授权；以子版本、分支版本、定制版等名义进行单独定价销售；使第三方误认为该衍生品为独立于优雅草的其它产品等。前述行为无论是否保留优雅草标识，均视为违反本协议，优雅草有权终止授权并追究法律责任。

6.2 You may not develop, package, name, or sell "derivative sub-versions" based on Youyacao products or your secondary development thereof. This includes but is not limited to: developing derivative, modified, or third-party distribution versions based on the product for sale or sublicensing; selling under the name of sub-version, branch version, custom version, etc.; or causing third parties to believe that such derivative is a product independent of Youyacao. Such conduct, whether or not Youyacao attribution is retained, is a breach of this agreement; Youyacao may terminate the license and pursue legal remedies.

6.3 禁止移除、篡改、遮挡授权官网链接、版权声明及授权验证相关标识；禁止对授权查询机制进行规避或破解。

6.3 You may not remove, alter, or obscure the License Site link, copyright notices, or license verification identifiers; you may not circumvent or crack any license verification mechanism.

6.4 禁止将本协议或授权官网未明确许可的权利再许可、转授或以其他方式授予第三方（转让授权依第五条第 5.3 款办理的除外）。

6.4 You may not sublicense, transfer, or otherwise grant to third parties any rights not expressly permitted in this agreement or on the License Site (except for license transfer under Section 5.3).

